Package: bfo.db
Type: Package
Title: Database Access for the Barefoot Ocean Data Platform
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Anastasiia", "Kostiv", email = "anastasiia.kostiv@blueventures.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a convenient R6 interface for connecting to the Barefoot
    Ocean PostgreSQL database over a secure (TLS) connection and retrieving
    database views. Connections can be configured from a 'config.yml' file or
    from direct parameters, and the AWS RDS 'us-east-1' CA bundle required for
    SSL verification is shipped with the package.
